    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOffers in Excess of 349,000\n\nArdilea is a charming 4 bedroom detached bungalow with large sunroom and beautiful mature rear garden which benefits from a generous \"concrete standing area\" (perfect for parking a motor home or storing a boat!). \nAccommodation includes; 4 bedrooms (main ensuite), a family bathroom, a large livingroom, a huge kitchen, a utility room and a sunroom.\n\nThe property is set back from the road on the Kilmore Quay side of Kilmore Village. Amenities in the village include a National School, Church, The famous Mary Barry's Seafood Restaurant, Quigleys Bar and bus links into Wexford Town.\n\nEasily accessible by car is Bridgetown Vocational School, Kilmore National School, numerous sandy beaches, the pretty village of Kilmore Quay , St. Helens and Rosslare Golf Clubs, the historic town of Wexford and the Europort in Rosslare Harbour.\n\nAll in all a great family home with easy access to many amenities!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - \nWith tiled flooring.\n\nEntrance Hall - 8.31m x 1.6m\nWith Maple flooring.\n\nHall - 4.26m x 1.58m\nWith Maple flooring and built in storage.\n\nHotpress - \n\n\nLiving Room - 4.14m x 3.53m\nGood sized room with Maple flooring, coving and wood burning stove.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.58m x 2.5m\nWith pine flooring.\n\nBathroom - 3.58m x 1.9m\nFully tiled with bath, w.c. w.h.b. and electric shower.\n\nKitchen - Dining Room - 6.6mx 4.16m\nFantastic spacious family room with generous waist and eye level storage, lofted ceiling, tiled flooring and splashbacks and double doors which access the large sunroom.\n\nSun Room - 3.6m x 3.45\nPrivate space that takes in the beautiful back garden, fabulous addition.\n\nUtilty Room / Back Porch - 4.04m x 1.95m\nSpacious with tiled flooring, fitted storage and plumbed for a washing machine.\n\nBedroom 2 Ensuite - 3.35m x 2.66m\nWith fitted storage.\n\nEnsuite - 2.48m x 1.65m\nFully tiled with electric shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.46m x 2.85m\nWith built in storage.\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.51 x 2.5m\nWith built in storage.\n\nDetached Garage - 5.5m x 5.5m\n\n\n"
      },
